Short: Scan ALL user accounts for duplicate names, phones, addresses, etc,..
Type: comm/cnet
Author: Kelly Cochran (trolan@gnomes.org)
Uploader: Kelly Cochran (trolan@gnomes.org)

	Dupescan is a power tool for C-Net.  Doing all of the same functions
efficiently, by hand, is impossible or, at least, _very_ time consuming.
This is a POWERFUL little utility for C-Net Amiga that scans your complete
user data file and notifies you of any POSSIBLE duplicate users (more than
one account per user).  DupeScanis a "smart" program.  When it is first run,
DupeScan proceeds through your COMPLETE userdata file and checks each and
every user for duplicate accounts by comparing Real Name, Address and Phone
Numbers (data and voice).  If it finds something that looks suspicious, it
will be written to your log of maint (sysdata:log/maint)
